Artists wanted for feature articles!! Hi everyone, hope you are all smiling on the Sunshine Coast. We are expanding our newsletter and will be hosting a feature artist of music/art/designer/writers/unique individuals...so if are one of these people or if you know someone who is.. please send details, including a brief bio and article to info@rhythmculture.com.au..feel free to add any events that you may have coming up! Look forward to hearing from you.....
